# Play test of Starfall Crater (CIPlay starfall_crater, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The crater lake in a ring round 2 28 (floor 8 m down, out to 18 m), the star's islet in it (2 m, star 11 m across, its east
# halves at 9.4 26.5 / 29.5, the ladder up its south face at 2 22); the camp on the south rim round 2 -6 (14 m) and the
# path down from it (2 -1 > -18 8 > -8 11.8 at the shore); the gullies on the east slope (z -5, 8, 21; their ends at 47).
island Starfall Crater
offset -0.0563 -0.7543
expect step 0
expect title Twelve Fragments
wait 5
expect animals Llama 3
expect animals Dolphin 2
at 2 -12 h=15
walk 2 -12 to 2 -6 h=14
zone camp
expect step 1
read Dr. Sato's field notes
expect step 2
use frag1
expect message Too cold to touch
open Instrument crate
expect story tongs 1
expect step 3
use frag1
use frag2
use frag3
expect story fragment 3
expect step 4
use frag4
expect story fragment 4
zone badlands
expect message Hyenas
kill Hyena
expect step 5
use frag5
use frag6
expect story fragment 6
expect step 6
at 2 -1 h=15
walk 2 -1 to -18 8 h=7.5
walk -18 8 to -8 11.8 h=1
at -6 15 h=0
zone lakebed
expect step 7
use frag7
use frag8
use frag9
expect story fragment 9
expect step 8
use cradle
expect message all twelve
at 2 26 h=9
use frag10
use frag11
use frag12
expect story fragment 12
expect step 9
use cradle
expect shown core
wait 6
at 9.4 26.6 h=3.5
walk 9.4 26.6 to 7.6 26.6 h=2
zone core
expect step 10
read Sato's last entry
expect step 11
open The star's heart
expect done
open Camp food box
open Abandoned sample bag
open Sunk sample case
open Supply boat barrel
